# lg-strict: the "as close to complete as DNS gets" tier. Use WITH lg-base.
# Blocks LG's whole service platforms for the TV. Expect, and accept:
#   - LG Content Store, app installs/updates, LG account sign-in stop working
#   - LG home screen loses icons/thumbnails and some rows; Search and voice stop
#   - firmware updates stop (lge.com) - so you also miss security fixes
#   - ThinQ / LG phone apps stop reaching the TV through the cloud
# Netflix, YouTube, Prime, Disney+, Plex, Jellyfin etc. use their own domains and keep working.
# Best scoped to the TV only (Pi-hole group / AdGuard client), see GUIDE.html.
# Generated 2026-11-25 by tools/build_blocklists.py - edit src/strict.txt

